{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.ImQDecayLinearResponse","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.ImQDecayLinearResponse","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.fig8Trace_im_real_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.fig8Trace_im_real_zero","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ImQDecayLinearResponse.lean#L55-L63","doc":"**Real substrate ⇒ no bar-odd signal.** At `ε = 0` the imaginary part\nvanishes: `Im T(q₀) = 0` for real `q₀` (the `Im q₀ = 0` mass fact — a real\nsubstrate carries no decay projection at this order). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.fig8Trace_im_odd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.fig8Trace_im_odd","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ImQDecayLinearResponse.lean#L43-L53","doc":"**Bar-odd ⇒ odd in ε.** `Im T(q₀ − iε) = − Im T(q₀ + iε)`: the decay part of\nthe figure-eight trace is an odd function of the imaginary perturbation `ε`.\nThis is the structural root of the c₃ `S` sign-flip (`sign S = sign ε`), so\n`S(muon) > 0 > S(proton)` forces `ε(muon) > 0 > ε(proton)` by parity — not by\na fit. At `ε = 0` (real `q₀`) both sides vanish: `Im S = 0` for real substrate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.fig8TraceC_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.fig8TraceC_conj","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ImQDecayLinearResponse.lean#L35-L41","doc":"**Real coefficients ⇒ conjugation commutes with evaluation.**\n`T(\\overline z) = \\overline{T(z)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.fig8TraceC","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.fig8TraceC","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ImQDecayLinearResponse.lean#L30-L33","doc":"Figure-eight operator trace on `ℂ` (merged #3600 closed form), a Laurent\nexpression with real integer coefficients. ","signatureChunk":0}]}